  "question": {
    "text": "A body hanging from a massless spring stretches it by <math><mn>3</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>cm</mi></math> on earth's surface. At a place <math><mn>800</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>km</mi></math> above the earth's surface, the same body will stretch the spring by (Radius of Earth <math><mo>=</mo><mn>6400</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>km</mi></math>)",
